### Override build step detection in Vercel Flags client

Source: https://vercel.com/docs/flags/vercel-flags/sdks/core

Explicitly set buildStep to true to skip network connections or false to enable streaming and polling. This is useful when environment auto-detection does not match your specific setup.

```typescript
